{"time": 1775652399, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1205796779", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（反正我们也没有购物环节（））"}
{"time": 1775652407, "type": "recv", "message_id": "959782801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“能不能稍微预支一点”"}
{"time": 1775652424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1657060592", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“小女子不过是外乡之人，也值得您如此信任吗？”"}
{"time": 1775652427, "type": "recv", "message_id": "310090673", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“喔。”接过档案看一眼"}
{"time": 1775652432, "type": "recv", "message_id": "484890330", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“喔。”接过档案看一眼"}
{"time": 1775652443, "type": "recv", "message_id": "135450652", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "879403626"}, "sender": {"id": "879403626", "name": "星间尘"}, "message": "”嗯“"}
{"time": 1775652445, "type": "recv", "message_id": "968547842", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "【档案一：艾琳·风车】\n身份：西风骑士团后勤兵，负责清剿低语森林一带的史莱姆\n昏迷时间：三天前\n发现地点：蒙德城侧门外，她当值后返回的途中\n异常表现：昏迷前曾抱怨“剑上的风元素不听使唤了”\n身份特征：拥有神之眼（风）\n\n【档案二：罗伊斯·铁砧】\n身份：自由冒险家，常年承接冒险家协会委托\n昏迷时间：五天前\n发现地点：天使的馈赠酒馆，他在饮酒时突然倒地\n异常表现：昏迷前一周曾探索过风啸坡一带，返回后反复做噩梦，“梦见自己被抽走了什么”\n身份特征：无神之眼，普通冒险者\n\n【档案三：玛格丽特·花语】\n身份：蒙德城花店“花语小筑”的店主\n昏迷时间：两天前\n发现地点：她自己的花店中\n异常表现：昏迷前三天开始极度嗜睡，她养的鲜花在夜间散发出“微弱而不自然的荧光”\n身份特征：无神之眼，"}
{"time": 1775652449, "type": "recv", "message_id": "855030105", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "879403626"}, "sender": {"id": "879403626", "name": "星间尘"}, "message": "（我也要嗯吗"}
{"time": 1775652485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "579034405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“还有一个共同点——骑士团的初步调查发现，他们三人在昏迷前一周内，都购买过同一家店铺的商品。那家店叫‘星银工坊’，是一家经营炼金材料和元素稳定剂的小店。店主名叫汉斯。”"}
{"time": 1775652504, "type": "recv", "message_id": "588872736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "879403626"}, "sender": {"id": "879403626", "name": "星间尘"}, "message": "”睡不可怕，蒙德城有凉爽的夏夜，可供人无忧的安眠"}
{"time": 1775652553, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1534300415", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“看起来元素稳定剂不是很稳定。”挑了挑眉毛"}
{"time": 1775652572, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2033882724", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“所以琴团长现在希望我们去那家工坊看看吗？”"}
{"time": 1775652572, "type": "recv", "message_id": "733083263", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "\"丽莎馆长有什么看法吗？\""}
{"time": 1775652575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1617741157", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "琴顿了顿，神情更加严肃。\n“另外……还有一个细节。昨晚，有人在星银工坊附近目击到了形迹可疑的人物——穿着异国服饰，行踪诡秘。我们的侦察兵认为，那可能是愚人众的人。”"}
{"time": 1775652578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "820393348", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“小女子也很羡慕这种得以安眠的事态。”摇摇折扇，“初步调查之后团长有什么线索吗？”"}
{"time": 1775652590, "type": "recv", "message_id": "636123057", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "\"另外这个店在城内吗？\""}
{"time": 1775652590, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2125151020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“芭芭拉怎么看”"}
{"time": 1775652605, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1778045225", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "店在蒙德城的城内"}
{"time": 1775652608, "type": "recv", "message_id": "60044281", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不是说芭芭拉试过了治不好）"}
{"time": 1775652613, "type": "recv", "message_id": "210176056", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“我需要你们去星银工坊调查。询问店主汉斯，弄清楚那种‘元素稳定剂’究竟是什么东西。如果愚人众真的牵扯其中……请务必小心。”"}
{"time": 1775652614, "type": "recv", "message_id": "325131685", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "879403626"}, "sender": {"id": "879403626", "name": "星间尘"}, "message": "“骑士团有询问店长情况吗”"}
{"time": 1775652625, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1388676591", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=60044281]（好的）[CQ:at,qq=825734198]"}
