{"time": 1775661640, "type": "recv", "message_id": "469850710", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“小女子今天已经没有再打一场的能力了。”"}
{"time": 1775661654, "type": "recv", "message_id": "500542815", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那我们回蒙德休息吧”"}
{"time": 1775661663, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1184849350", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“怪唬人的，不过这些东西怎么动起来的？还挺有意思的诶”凑到构造体旁边挑挑拣拣"}
{"time": 1775661676, "type": "recv", "message_id": "452055757", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“居然有六把剑，让我把它们融了”"}
